<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has started coverage of Micron Electronics Inc with a rating of hold, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened unchanged at 18-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
